  "solution": "<ol class=\"alpha-list\"><li>Ta có <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mo>sin</mo><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>α</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mn>9</mn><mn>25</mn></mfrac></mrow></semantics></math> và <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mo>cos</mo><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>α</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mn>16</mn><mn>25</mn></mfrac></mrow></semantics></math>.\n\t\t\tKhi đó, <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mo>sin</mo><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>α</mi><mo>+</mo><msup><mo>cos</mo><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>α</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mn>9</mn><mn>25</mn></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mn>16</mn><mn>25</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></semantics></math>.<br>Vậy các đẳng thức <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>sin</mo><mi>α</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mn>3</mn><mn>5</mn></mfrac></mrow></semantics></math> và <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>cos</mo><mi>α</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mn>4</mn><mn>5</mn></mfrac></mrow></semantics></math> có thể đồng thời xảy ra.</li><li>Ta có <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mn>1</mn><mrow><msup><mo>sin</mo><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>α</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>9</mn></mrow></semantics></math> và <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msup><mo>cot</mo><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>α</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mn>1</mn><mn>4</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mn>5</mn><mn>4</mn></mfrac></mrow></semantics></math>.<br>Vậy các đẳng thức  <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>sin</mo><mi>α</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mn>1</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac></mrow></semantics></math> và <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>cot</mo><mi>α</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mrow></semantics></math> không đồng thời xảy ra.</li><li>Ta có <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>tan</mo><mi>α</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>⇒</mo><mo>cot</mo><mi>α</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mn>1</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac></mrow></semantics></math>.<br>Vậy các đẳng thức <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>tan</mo><mi>α</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></semantics></math> và <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>cot</mo><mi>α</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mn>1</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac></mrow></semantics></math> đồng thời xảy ra.</li></ol>",
